WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.864
Namaste! YourKhata ek platform hai, jahan
business apna saara hisaab — bills, stock,
payments aur collections — ek hi jagah
rakhta hai.

00:00:10.314 --> 00:00:18.139
Is video mein dekhiye Shop & billing
module, jo aaj live hai — ek dukaan ke
saath, phone par, shuru se aakhir tak.

00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:25.239
Sabse pehle account banate hain. Iske liye
sirf ek email aur password chahiye.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.440
Apna email likhiye.

00:00:30.595 --> 00:00:35.490
Ab ek mazboot password banaiye. Password
hamesha chhupa rehta hai.

00:00:36.193 --> 00:00:40.442
Create account par tap kijiye. Bas, aapka
account ban gaya.

00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:47.302
Ab apni dukaan ki jaankari bharte hain.
Sirf chaar chhote steps hain.

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:55.705
Apna naam aur dukaan ka naam likhiye —
Sharma General Store — aur business type
mein Retail shop chuniye.

00:00:56.832 --> 00:01:00.101
State chuniye — Maharashtra — aur Continue
dabaiye.

00:01:05.405 --> 00:01:14.156
GST registered hain to Regular GST chuniye
aur apna GSTIN likhiye. Registered nahi
hain to skip kar dijiye.

00:01:14.862 --> 00:01:19.887
Dukaan ka pata likhiye. Ye aapke bill aur
statement ke upar chhapega.

00:01:24.863 --> 00:01:32.364
Aakhri step mein YourKhata batata hai ki
aapke kaam ke hisaab se kya-kya set hoga.
Start par tap kijiye.

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:39.602
Ye hai aapka dashboard. Yahan ek nazar
mein poori dukaan dikhti hai.

00:01:41.257 --> 00:01:47.384
To collect — sabse kitna paisa lena hai.
To pay — suppliers ko kitna dena hai.

00:01:48.095 --> 00:01:53.250
Aaj ki sale, galle mein cash, aur kaunsa
maal khatam ho raha hai — sab yahin.

00:01:53.954 --> 00:02:01.024
Upar menu button se saare hisse khulte
hain: Customers, Bills, Items, Purchases,
Reports aur Settings.

00:02:01.738 --> 00:02:05.611
Chaliye, pehla kaam karte hain — ek
customer ka udhaar likhna.

00:02:07.844 --> 00:02:18.171
Problem: kaagaz par udhaar likhne mein
galti hoti hai, aur baad mein behas hoti
hai. YourKhata mein har entry tareekh ke
saath save hoti hai.

00:02:19.822 --> 00:02:25.460
Plus button se naya customer jodiye. Naam
likhiye — Ramesh Traders — aur mobile
number.

00:02:27.268 --> 00:02:31.115
Save party dabaiye. Ramesh Traders ka
khata khul gaya.

00:02:33.796 --> 00:02:42.214
Ramesh ji ₹1,200 ka ration udhaar le gaye.
"You gave" par tap kijiye, amount aur note
likhiye, Save.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:49.088
Kuch din baad unhone ₹500 de diye. Is baar
"You got" par tap kijiye.

00:02:50.735 --> 00:02:57.285
Result: balance apne aap ₹700 ho gaya. Har
entry tareekh ke saath neeche list mein
hai.

00:02:57.993 --> 00:03:05.251
Customer ko poora hisaab dikhana ho, to
teen dots se "Statement" kholiye — har
entry, running balance ke saath.

00:03:07.507 --> 00:03:14.138
Udhaar maangna thoda awkward lagta hai.
YourKhata ek polite message taiyaar kar
deta hai.

00:03:15.789 --> 00:03:23.843
Teen dots wale button se "Send reminder"
chuniye. Message mein naam, baaki rakam
aur dukaan ka naam pehle se likha hai.

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:31.891
WhatsApp par tap kijiye — message seedha
Ramesh ji ke number par khulta hai. Aapko
sirf Send dabana hai.

00:03:32.597 --> 00:03:42.683
Aging screen batati hai kiska udhaar kitne
dino se pada hai. Fayda: sabse purane
udhaar wale ko pehle phone kijiye, paisa
jaldi wapas aayega.

00:03:44.923 --> 00:03:54.598
Reminder ke baad Suresh Kumar ne ₹1,000
PhonePe se bhej diye. Ise record karte
hain, taaki bill aur khata dono update ho
jaayein.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:01.395
Suresh Kumar ka khata kholiye, teen dots
dabaiye aur "Record payment" chuniye.

00:04:03.863 --> 00:04:08.748
Amount ₹1,000 likhiye, PhonePe chuniye,
aur Save payment dabaiye.

00:04:11.248 --> 00:04:20.586
Ho gaya! Receipt number ban gaya aur
balance kam ho gaya. Pehle baaki bill
chukta hota hai; jo rakam bachi, wo
advance ban kar rehti hai.

00:04:22.879 --> 00:04:30.834
Maal khatam hone ka pata aksar tab chalta
hai jab customer maang leta hai. Items
screen ye problem hal karti hai.

00:04:32.484 --> 00:04:38.313
Har item ke saath dukaan mein kitna maal
hai, wo dikhta hai. Stock value bhi upar
hai.

00:04:39.021 --> 00:04:44.416
"Low" tab par tap kijiye — Sugar kam hai.
Ye reorder level se neeche aa gaya hai.

00:04:45.123 --> 00:04:50.505
Item kholne par har aana-jaana dikhta hai
— opening stock, bikri aur kharid.

00:04:52.761 --> 00:05:01.235
Haath se GST bill banana dheema hai, aur
tax ka hisaab galat ho sakta hai. Dekhiye
YourKhata mein kitna aasaan hai.

00:05:02.886 --> 00:05:07.298
Bills mein plus dabaiye. "Party" chuniye
aur Ramesh Traders dhoondiye.

00:05:17.073 --> 00:05:25.087
Ab item jodiye — Basmati Rice 5kg,
quantity 2. Rate aur GST item se apne aap
aa jaate hain.

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:29.253
Ek aur item — Toor Dal 1kg, quantity 3.

00:05:34.135 --> 00:05:41.717
Neeche total dekhiye. Same state ka
customer hai, isliye CGST aur SGST apne
aap lag gaya.

00:05:42.432 --> 00:05:50.156
Issue dabaiye. Ramesh ji abhi ₹500 UPI se
de rahe hain — amount badliye, UPI
chuniye.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:58.459
"Received ₹500 · Issue" dabaiye. Bill ban
gaya, stock kam ho gaya, aur baaki rakam
Ramesh ji ke khata mein jud gayi.

00:05:59.164 --> 00:06:05.736
Bill par UPI QR code bhi chhapta hai —
customer scan karke turant paisa bhej
sakta hai.

00:06:06.441 --> 00:06:10.797
"Share on WhatsApp" se bill ka link
customer ko chala jaata hai.

00:06:11.507 --> 00:06:18.806
Customer ke phone par bill aisa dikhta hai
— dukaan ka naam, items, total aur baaki
rakam. Bina app ke.

00:06:21.077 --> 00:06:28.400
Sugar kam tha, to Gupta Wholesale se
pachaas packet mangwaye. Unka bill bhi
YourKhata mein daal dete hain.

00:06:30.052 --> 00:06:36.311
Purchases mein plus dabaiye aur supplier
chuniye — Gupta Wholesale. Unka bill
number bhi likhiye.

00:06:40.858 --> 00:06:45.160
Item — Sugar 1kg, quantity 50, cost ₹40.

00:06:49.582 --> 00:06:55.656
Record dabaiye. Stock mein 50 Sugar jud
gayi, aur Gupta Wholesale ka hisaab bhi
likh gaya.

00:06:57.928 --> 00:07:04.347
Chai, auto, bijli ke chhote kharche aksar
likhe nahi jaate. Phir shaam ko galla nahi
milta.

00:07:05.998 --> 00:07:12.944
Expenses mein plus dabaiye. Amount ₹250,
category chuniye, Cash, aur note —
Delivery auto.

00:07:20.941 --> 00:07:28.002
Save kijiye. Ab Cashbook mein har din ka
opening, aaya paisa, gaya paisa aur
closing — sab milta hai.

00:07:32.179 --> 00:07:36.603
Mahine ke end mein CA ko hisaab dena ab
bada kaam nahi hai.

00:07:38.253 --> 00:07:42.737
Day book mein aaj ka har bill, payment aur
kharcha kram se dikhta hai.

00:07:47.252 --> 00:07:56.417
GST summary mein rate ke hisaab se tax ka
poora hisaab milta hai. Download button se
CSV file CA ko bhej dijiye.

00:07:58.665 --> 00:08:04.036
Dukaan par helper hai? Apna password mat
dijiye. Uska alag login banaiye.

00:08:05.687 --> 00:08:11.731
Team mein "Add member" dabaiye. Naam —
Vikas — email, aur role mein Staff
chuniye. Create login.

00:08:16.269 --> 00:08:27.543
Ek temporary password banta hai — video
mein hum use chhupa rahe hain. Ise
WhatsApp se Vikas ko bhejiye; pehli baar
login par wo apna naya password banayega.

00:08:28.246 --> 00:08:35.657
Settings mein dukaan ki jaankari, bill ka
rang aur logo, aur apna poora data
download karne ka option hai.

00:08:37.971 --> 00:08:40.695
Aur haan, poora app Hindi mein bhi chalta
hai.

00:08:42.345 --> 00:08:47.762
Upar profile button dabaiye aur Hindi
chuniye. Poora app Hindi mein badal gaya.

00:08:52.995 --> 00:09:00.208
To ye tha YourKhata — ek platform, jahan
aapka hisaab, bills, stock aur collections
ek jagah rehte hain.

00:09:00.658 --> 00:09:08.736
Lending & collections, Library, Gym &
fitness aur Hotel & stays modules planned
hain — ye abhi app mein nahi hain.

00:09:09.186 --> 00:09:14.593
YourKhata ke saath apne business ka hisaab
aaj hi shuru kijiye. Dhanyavaad!
